    "en": {
      "trackName": "Save Me!",
      "description": "**SAVE ME! — A Tiny Puzzle Adventure!**\n\nOne terrified office worker. One hundred dangerous situations. Only you can save him!\n\nPull the pins in the right order to guide our unlucky hero through a world of lava, monsters, falling rocks, explosions and ridiculous disasters.\n\nEvery puzzle is a new challenge. Think carefully, choose which pin to pull first, and watch the chaos unfold!\n\n**100 PUZZLES TO SOLVE**\n\nWork your way through 100 carefully designed levels, from simple rescues to challenging multi-step puzzles.\n\n**PULL THE RIGHT PIN!**\n\nOne tap can change everything. Release water, redirect lava, drop rocks, defeat monsters and open the path to safety.\n\n**WATCH THE CHAOS UNFOLD**\n\nEnjoy colorful cartoon graphics, animated environments, funny characters and satisfying interactions.\n\n**BUILT FOR APPLE WATCH**\n\nDesigned specifically for your wrist, with simple touch controls, short puzzles and quick retries.\n\n**NO PRESSURE. JUST PUZZLES.**\n\nNo timers, no lives, no advertisements and no in-app purchases. Take your time and solve each rescue at your own pace.\n\nCan you survive all 100 disasters?\n\n**SAVE ME!**",
